title: Does your own server, over your notes, move too? I recommend it stays on this laptop.
pid: a9d32b00-5f3e-4914-8150-8e3b5c68ff4b
body: |2-
  Your editor waits on it at every save and view; across the ocean each
  would wait about a sixth of a second longer (an estimate). Leaving it
  here also takes 1.3 GB off the rented machine. Assumed everywhere
  below: Claude, the builds and the tests run on the rented machine;
  your editor and your own server stay here.
  If you do not answer, it stays here.
